{
  "_about": "Shared cases for the FINAL rule: frontend isFinalAmount (utils/generatedInvoices.ts) and backend is_final (services/wo_generated_invoices.py) must both give `final`. Read by utils/generatedInvoices.test.ts and services/test_wo_generated_invoices.py.",
